{"comment_text": {"ja6:0.1": "", "ja6:0.2": "", "ja6:0.3": "", "ja6:0.4": "", "ja6:1.1": "The story tells of how two brothers are asked by a water-spirit what are “godly qualities”. Their replies—“the sun and moon” and the “four directions”—win them only imprisonment. The third brother replies correctly. ", "ja6:1.2": "", "ja6:1.3": "", "ja6:1.4": "<i lang='pi' translate='no'>Devadhamma</i> (“godly qualities”) appears at <a href='https://suttacentral.net/ja458/en/sujato#7.3'>Ja 458:7.3</a> where it means “god’s character”. ", "ja6:2.1": ""}, "html_text": {"ja6:0.1": "<article id='ja6'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja6:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja6:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja6:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja6:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja6:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja6:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja6:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja6:2.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja6:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja6:0.2": "Ekakanipāta ", "ja6:0.3": "Apaṇṇakavagga ", "ja6:0.4": "6. Devadhammajātaka ", "ja6:1.1": "“Hiriottappasampannā, ", "ja6:1.2": "sukkadhammasamāhitā; ", "ja6:1.3": "Santo sappurisā loke, ", "ja6:1.4": "devadhammāti vuccare”ti. ", "ja6:2.1": "Devadhammajātakaṁ chaṭṭhaṁ. "}, "translation_text": {"ja6:0.1": "Stories of Past Lives 6 ", "ja6:0.2": "The Book of the Ones ", "ja6:0.3": "Sure Bet ", "ja6:0.4": "Godly Qualities: a past life story ", "ja6:1.1": "Endowed with conscience and prudence, ", "ja6:1.2": "and comprised of bright qualities, ", "ja6:1.3": "the good and true persons in the world ", "ja6:1.4": "are said to have godly qualities. ", "ja6:2.1": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja6:0.1": "", "ja6:0.2": "", "ja6:0.3": "", "ja6:0.4": "", "ja6:1.1": "dr27.3, ms22J_12, msdiv6, pts-vp-pli1.129, sya27.3", "ja6:1.2": "", "ja6:1.3": "", "ja6:1.4": "", "ja6:2.1": "ms22J_13"}, "keys_order": ["ja6:0.1", "ja6:0.2", "ja6:0.3", "ja6:0.4", "ja6:1.1", "ja6:1.2", "ja6:1.3", "ja6:1.4", "ja6:2.1"]}